==Strategies==
These ten stages aren't very threatening on their own with the relative weak support backing Gigahaniwanwan. Still, it would be advisable to bring specialists that can handle them so Gigahanwanwan can be engaged as soon as possible.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]]: Hits both Relic Doge and Doge Dark, as well as Sir Rel. Also chips down Nimoy Bore and Gigahaniwan during its TBA, and even works as CC for Nimoy if you got Can Can's Target Alien [[Talents|Talent]].
*[[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]]: Pizza's Massive vs. Dark shreds through Dark Otter quickly.
*[[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]]: Blocks Gigahaniwan's Level 4 Waves from Cursing or applying CC effects onto your units that can't outrange Gigahaniwan.

